# Gameplay. Up and left into the cheerleader waiting there â€” the score goes
# 0 -> 1000 by frame 1980, which is a rescue, which is a collision dispatch.
1860   Up+Left
# Back down and across the lawn, then into the graveyard south of it, which by
# frame 2500 has five zombies in it. From here on B is held down, which was
# meant to be the water pistol and is not (see the correction above): what this
# stretch actually produces is 1,226 collisions between a player and the things
# chasing him, and no shots at all.
